1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,198
Wandering through a wasteland of cold iron, Pip searched for the answer that haunted his circuits: Who made me... and where did they go?

2
00:00:08,198 --> 00:00:17,107
Until buried beneath the ruins, he uncovered an impossible spark: a single fragile sprout, glowing with bioluminescent life.

3
00:00:17,107 --> 00:00:24,313
And resting beside it was humanity's final message: To whoever finds this... take care of what remains.

4
00:00:24,313 --> 00:00:26,213
Pip looked down with gentle awe.

5
00:00:26,213 --> 00:00:27,512
He was not abandoned.

6
00:00:27,512 --> 00:00:28,590
He was chosen.

7
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:31,200
To be the guardian of a brand new world.

8
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:39,571
And with one warm drop of devotion, life exploded across the horizon, blooming into an endless sea of golden light.

9
00:00:39,571 --> 00:00:42,781
Proving that love will always outlive rust.

